open source, distributed, et cetera.
Tim Ferriss: I know we've talked about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:30.000
this before and you've certainly talked about it&nbsp;
in other places, but we're going to get into a&nbsp;&nbsp;

